  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Credit Program for Safeguarding the Productive Fabric and Economic Recovery</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Global de Crdito para la Defensa del Tejido Productivo y la Recuperacin Econmica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es apoyar la sostenibilidad de las MiPyME como principal fuente del empleo en Mxico, frente a la crisis del COVID-19. El objetivo especfico es promover la recuperacin econmica a travs del acceso al financiamiento productivo de las MiPyME</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to support the sustainability of MSMEs as the main source of employment in Mexico, in the face of the COVID-19 crisis. The specific objective is to promote economic recovery through access to productive financing for MSMEs</narrative>
  </description>
